# admin.rkt, player.rkt and strategy.rkt (merged to keep the configuration count down; see
# NOTES.md). in-sandbox runs the producer and passes its result to the consumer (it never fails:
# errors are not caught by the original either), so the failure continuations are not taken.

# ---- strategy.rkt ----

